  "abstract": "Sweep monotonicity prior strength on \u03b3[t]. Same base as SOTA (p=36, H=160, drop=0.05, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124). No smoothness term; only monotone penalty \u03bbm=2e\u22125.",
